{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>受英偉達CEO黃仁勳辭職事件持續影響，周一美股三大指數集體收跌，</strong>截至收盤道瓊斯指數跌1.41%報51608.17點，標普500指數跌1.92%報7416.59點，納斯達克綜合指數跌2.49%報24509.76點，納斯達克100指數收跌2.67%。美股恐慌指數VIX（標普500波動率指數）上漲18.7%報22.91點，收於11月9日以來最高水平。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586744.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.838906+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"dbf3e446b917d7b9bbce01e71169084af7440ad5388fd97f7b5051c1dfbc476b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}